  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"6 plus 7 r equals p w\"><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>w</mi></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"7 r minus 5 w equals 5 w plus 11\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>7</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>r</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>w</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>w</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>11</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">In the given system of equations, <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi>\n</math> is a constant. If the system has no solution, what is the value of <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
  "answerOptions": [],
